    description: "The QMBL paper"
abstract: >-
  Published ground-state energies for lattice Hamiltonians and the electron gas, with the
  record for each instance. Energies are ranked. Each row has a bound_type that says what
  kind of number the energy is, and cites the primary paper that produced the number. Some
  rows are imported from VarBench, the dataset published with the V-score paper (Wu et al.,
  Science 386, 296 (2024); Apache-2.0).
